1
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,760
What a pity, mother

2
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:45,240
Even if you know my entire plan

3
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,640
Your son has grown up

4
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,400
And won't be manipulated by you anymore

5
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,800
He still insists on this plan

6
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,160
I failed to take revenge

7
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,880
All because you're a spy from Northern Jin

8
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,880
I lost my chance to be crown prince

9
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:08,000
I hate having your blood in my veins

10
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,960
Precisely because I'm your biological son

11
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,840
I risked execution

12
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:18,960
To go to Northern Jin as hostage and seize the Dragon Jade

13
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,000
To fight for what's mine

14
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:24,680
That throne rightfully belongs to me

15
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,120
Since you've returned now

16
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:38,360
I'll just kill you again

17
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,360
Zhi'an

18
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,440
Zhi'an! Zhi'an!

19
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,440
How is he, doctor?

20
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,320
Your Highness the Seventh Prince

21
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,680
His pulse appears normal

22
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,720
He needs proper rest

23
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,240
I'll take my leave now

24
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,880
Didn't the doctor say I'm fine?

25
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,760
What was Zhu Huaijin groping around for?

26
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,880
Not frightened at all

27
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,160
Zhi'an

28
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:52,960
Where is this place?

29
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,680
Who are you? Stay away!

30
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,600
Zhi'an, Zhi'an, it's me

31
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,840
Ghost! There's a ghost!

32
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,240
Zhi'an, it's me

33
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,440
My husband?

34
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,840
Is that you, my husband?

35
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,480
Yes, it's me, Zhi'an

36
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:07,720
Husband

37
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,840
I was so scared

38
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:14,120
I heard a woman talking to me continuously in the ancestral temple

39
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,480
Then I don't remember anything after that

40
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,440
It's alright, it's alright Zhi'an

41
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,720
I'm here

42
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:20,920
I'll protect you

43
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,800
This will pass

44
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,760
Aren't you going to ask about my possession?

45
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,760
You don't really believe

46
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,840
that Lee Ji-an is possessed by Zhu Huaichen's mother, do you?

47
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,520
How is that possible?

48
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:35,440
If ghosts really existed in this world

49
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:38,400
her entire family's spirits would have already come out to strangle her

50
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,400
There wouldn't be any need for you to work so hard to protect her

51
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,840
Nothing is impossible

52
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,840
Ji-an is simply blessed with good fortune

53
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:50,240
Even if possessed, she wouldn't be affected

54
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,960
If even I can be reborn

55
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:57,240
what in this world could be impossible?

56
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,200
You...

57
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,840
Fine, I have nothing more to say

58
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,000
He actually believed it just like that?

59
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,200
Absolutely true

60
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:12,920
I heard it with my own ears - the Seventh

61
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:17,320
The Third Prince said you're blessed with good fortune

62
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,840
which is why you weren't frightened by this incident

63
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:22,480
This man isn't as clever as I thought

64
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:26,200
I think he's simply blinded by love

65
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,920
Whatever the Crown Princess says

66
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,160
How could any imperial prince truly believe in love?

67
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,520
Impossible.

68
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,840
All tenderness shown by royalty

69
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,240
is merely a tool in their power struggles.

70
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,480
How could there be genuine affection for me?

71
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,000
The imperial consort sees through this so clearly.

72
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,240
Then why did you marry the Third Prince?

73
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,840
I see you spending every day

74
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,080
in apparent marital bliss with the prince.

75
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,640
Surely you married him with sincere devotion.

76
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:55,960
My devotion was indeed sincere.

77
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,200
Who are you?

78
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:15,200
Why were you hanging there?

79
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,680
Stay back! Get away!

80
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,360
Are you alright?

81
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,840
Watch out!

82
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,880
My eyes!

83
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,120
I can't see!

84
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,280
Miss Li!

85
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:04,800
Miss, you've been bitten by a venomous snake on your foot,

86
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:06,480
which is affecting your vision temporarily.

87
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,480
Who are you?

88
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,440
Oh, I'm the person you just saved.

89
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,560
You were bitten by a venomous snake on your foot.

90
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:16,600
So I took off your shoe to let the blood out.

91
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,600
If I've offended you in any way,

92
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,160
please forgive me, miss.

93
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,160
You know who I am?

94
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,320
I...

95
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,440
Miss Li, I just gathered some medicinal herbs.

96
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:28,960
Oh right,

97
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:31,880
here's your dagger.

98
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:42,720
Who exactly are you?

99
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,480
How do you know me?

100
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,840
Don't panic, Miss Li.

101
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,320
You could say we're old acquaintances.

102
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,280
Oh right,

103
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,360
this is the golden herb I just picked for you.

104
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,000
It has detoxifying properties.

105
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,480
Since we don't have any other medicine available now,

106
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,160
let's apply this herb for now.

107
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,720
Hmm.

108
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,200
It's all my fault

109
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,480
Making Miss Li wait for so long

110
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:37,000
I remember the Golden Cliff Grass grows on the precipice

111
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,840
Your legs seem to be covered in wounds

112
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,200
How did you manage to pick it?

113
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,480
It's nothing serious

114
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,880
How did you hurt your hand?

115
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,680
It's fine, no trouble at all

116
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:55,560
There's no other way at the moment

117
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:59,200
We must hurry down the mountain tomorrow to find a doctor

118
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,360
I'll go find some food first

119
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,600
You should rest now

120
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:04,080
Mm-hmm

121
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,360
Miss Li

122
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:31,040
You'll have to make do with some fruits for now

123
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:37,880
How did you hurt your hand again?

124
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:41,280
Don't worry about it, you eat first

125
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,440
Let me give you this dagger

126
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,920
Use it to protect yourself

127
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,480
Don't get hurt anymore

128
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,640
Thank you, Miss Li

129
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,600
Miss Li

130
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,400
What's wrong with you?

131
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,880
We should go down the mountain to find a doctor

132
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,640
But you'll never know

133
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:28,480
what intentions that person had when approaching you

134
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:31,800
Only remembering the comfort and sweetness of being together

135
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:36,800
Only to discover in the end that everything might have been lies

136
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,000
Zhi'an, Zhi'an

137
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,120
My eyes

138
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,360
I can't see anymore

139
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,160
Don't panic

140
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,280
Miss

141
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,480
Stay calm

142
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:56,680
Who are you?

143
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,120
I'm the Third Prince of Nanliang

144
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,320
Zhu Huaichen

145
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:08,760
It's as if the person you were with back then

146
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,520
wasn't the one standing before you now

147
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:16,280
Imperial Consort, the one you've been with all along isn't...

148
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:17,520
Are you sitting on the ground?

149
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,040
The ground is cold, get up

150
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,960
No, Crown Princess

151
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,160
Please listen to me

152
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,840
The person you've been interacting with all along

153
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,920
I know, Hua Mei

154
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:29,920
You need to hear this

155
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:34,040
The world is full of fascinating ironies

156
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,720
Some people think they're clever enough

157
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,120
To deceive everyone

158
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,840
But heaven's justice is clear

159
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,280
The gods bear witness

160
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,120
Though my eyes may be blind

161
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,840
My heart sees clearly

162
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,840
Who treats me sincerely

163
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,320
Who treats me falsely

164
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:51,160
I know perfectly well

165
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:53,080
Are you saying you know about Qi...

166
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,560
I know, I know

167
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,880
I know you

168
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,520
You've truly been kind to me

169
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:01,120
And I consider you my dear sister

170
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:02,960
Crown Princess

171
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,040
How could a mere maid like me deserve

172
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:07,200
Such treatment from you

173
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:08,800
Dear sister, you absolutely deserve it

174
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,040
I'm feeling rather tired now

175
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:16,520
Would you stay and sleep beside me tonight?

176
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:22,000
Hua Mei, through two lifetimes

177
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,680
I've been fortunate to have your sincere heart

178
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:27,080
But I can't let things become more complicated

179
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,960
You want what's best for me

180
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,680
And I must do what's best for you
